   "xml_name": "PS3_010_Movie Ticket Price",
   "display_name": "Movie Ticket Price",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>A cinema sets the ticket price by age:</p>\n<ul><li>below 12 years: <b>100</b> rupees</li><li>12 to 59 years (both included): <b>200</b> rupees</li><li>60 years or more: <b>150</b> rupees</li></ul>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> write a program that reads an age (a non-negative integer, int &gt;= 0), and prints the ticket price.</p>\n<p><b>Example 1:</b> if the user types</p>\n<pre>8</pre>\n<p>your program should print</p>\n<pre>100</pre>\n<p><b>Example 2:</b> if the user types</p>\n<pre>12</pre>\n<p>your program should print</p>\n<pre>200</pre>\n<p><b>Example 3:</b> if the user types</p>\n<pre>60</pre>\n<p>your program should print</p>\n<pre>150</pre>",
